                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "1fbb5bb6-31af-40fe-8e7e-6767d61e0550",
                        "entry_id": "c34407a4-bdc8-311a-b637-6bb759560c97",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "ска́льдах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cb6442be-1d85-314e-9dc9-58c1a377f0a1",
                        "entry_id": "c34407a4-bdc8-311a-b637-6bb759560c97",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор. древнескандинавский поэт-певец"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1dd83b3-0248-452c-a250-e2dd94dd4fd3",
                                "sense_id": "cb6442be-1d85-314e-9dc9-58c1a377f0a1",
                                "text": "Возвращаясь к скальдам, припомним, что они сопровождали героев во всех важных предприятиях. Олаф Святой, собирая войско против Конута Датского, велел призвать к себе четверых скальдов, «Теперь высматривайте все достойное примечания, ― сказал он им, ― чтобы было вам о чем петь и рассказывать». Песня скальда имела характер по преимуществу военный."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "88a4db89-71f0-4c45-a0b0-86c5838b9b72",
                                "sense_id": "cb6442be-1d85-314e-9dc9-58c1a377f0a1",
                                "text": "Воспой нам песнь любви и брани, // О скальд, свидетель древних лет, // Твой меч тяжёл для слабой длани, // Но глас века переживет!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1af99ca3-0b96-4b8d-bed5-1b97119bc128",
                        "source_entry_id": "c34407a4-bdc8-311a-b637-6bb759560c97",
                        "source_sense_id": "cb6442be-1d85-314e-9dc9-58c1a377f0a1",
                        "target_lang_word": "skald",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "skald",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f560e0b4-9300-38d1-be0d-5e1fc28583b1",
                                        "entry_id": "214f4cb3-5f5b-312e-abbb-ffc0078d1ff7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A Nordic poet of the Viking Age."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d17bf3a3-bb0d-4b63-8569-e3e32c3205d6",
                                                "sense_id": "f560e0b4-9300-38d1-be0d-5e1fc28583b1",
                                                "text": "The fire was spreading rapidly through all parts of the castle, when Ulrica, who had first kindled it, appeared on a turret, in the guise of one of the ancient furies, yelling forth a war-song, such as was of yore chaunted on the field of battle by the scalds of the yet heathen Saxons."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29c44a9a-4be9-48b0-845b-4ce10933448c",
                                                "sense_id": "f560e0b4-9300-38d1-be0d-5e1fc28583b1",
                                                "text": "Command Egil the Skald to stand forth and stir our viking blood with his songs of thee."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c4106f1b-60a6-4134-ad49-4eb9bb12e724",
                        "source_entry_id": "c34407a4-bdc8-311a-b637-6bb759560c97",
                        "source_sense_id": "cb6442be-1d85-314e-9dc9-58c1a377f0a1",
                        "target_lang_word": "scald",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "scald",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "deade959-f2ab-3fab-a51c-e43f0aa6a17a",
                                        "entry_id": "213b837e-dd64-3da5-a3a2-5fb27bf2259d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To burn with hot liquid."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d16116c8-e9ac-41a1-8fd8-864483c6ef1d",
                                                "sense_id": "deade959-f2ab-3fab-a51c-e43f0aa6a17a",
                                                "text": "Here the blue flames of scalding brimstone fall."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5a89597-48aa-4b01-aad9-084939da9a15",
                                                "sense_id": "deade959-f2ab-3fab-a51c-e43f0aa6a17a",
                                                "text": "The fireman was scalded by steam, but he did not fare so badly as the enemy pilot, whose dead body was found on a bank about 100 yd. away from the train."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66f57502-c526-45ec-a06a-309ba51d9639",
                                                "sense_id": "deade959-f2ab-3fab-a51c-e43f0aa6a17a",
                                                "text": "to scald the hand"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1b28dd3-2e46-44b0-87fe-96e3d59272fd",
                                                "sense_id": "deade959-f2ab-3fab-a51c-e43f0aa6a17a",
                                                "text": "Mine own tears / Do scald like molten lead."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "83e8f381-3680-3e8a-b115-0d75330ba21f",
                                        "entry_id": "213b837e-dd64-3da5-a3a2-5fb27bf2259d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To heat almost to boiling."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03e80e64-db45-49cb-8763-27cccb6fca48",
                                                "sense_id": "83e8f381-3680-3e8a-b115-0d75330ba21f",
                                                "text": "Scald the milk until little bubbles form."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "scald",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2233d8e-4f3b-398a-b1ce-4e36c4125c27",
                                        "entry_id": "bc86f3f0-05aa-3095-93ca-e3f347e258bf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A burn, or injury to the skin or flesh, by hot liquid or steam."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5efcb6f7-ba56-300c-a985-d9d47e1a423e",
                                        "entry_id": "bc86f3f0-05aa-3095-93ca-e3f347e258bf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Poor or bad land."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Appalachia"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "scald",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5128c98e-05a6-3875-b465-aa9153d33f93",
                                        "entry_id": "0982c3f1-7a8b-37f9-ad1c-7f6611656e27",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Scaliness; a scabby skin disease."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b92797f3-50c3-4f01-b158-3aad861ddc7b",
                                                "sense_id": "5128c98e-05a6-3875-b465-aa9153d33f93",
                                                "text": "Her craftie head was altogether bald, / And as in hate of honorable eld, / Was ouergrowne with scurfe and filthy scald[…]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e4c5f83-6f96-4a36-96f4-a928f2900fd2",
                                                "sense_id": "5128c98e-05a6-3875-b465-aa9153d33f93",
                                                "text": "Some heale Horses, some cure men, some the plague, some the scald [translating teigne], some the cough, some one kinde of scab, and some another[…]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "scald",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "17bad357-7dd6-3f9e-b9bf-4f4179b9d6e2",
                                        "entry_id": "8e9b8351-5a1d-3eef-b445-ce9fa558eeb4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Affected with the scab; scabby."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6559bddb-d64d-4811-86a4-12e0d03a8fe0",
                                                "sense_id": "17bad357-7dd6-3f9e-b9bf-4f4179b9d6e2",
                                                "text": "and let us knog our / prains together to be revenge on this same scald, scurvy, / cogging companion,"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "947f299f-c7dd-3b0e-af25-7950c290cd5c",
                                        "entry_id": "8e9b8351-5a1d-3eef-b445-ce9fa558eeb4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Paltry; worthless."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "694803b8-ea3e-4a42-831f-d67e79a603f7",
                                                "sense_id": "947f299f-c7dd-3b0e-af25-7950c290cd5c",
                                                "text": "Would it not grieue a King to be so abuſ’d?\nAnd haue a thouſand horſmen tane away?\nAnd which is worſe to haue his Diadem\nSought for by ſuch ſcalde knaues as loue him not?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e8cf457-f5d1-462a-a5c3-9c9e095a9dc4",
                                                "sense_id": "947f299f-c7dd-3b0e-af25-7950c290cd5c",
                                                "text": "Saucy lictors / Will catch at us like strumpets, and scald rhymers / Ballad us out o' tune."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "scald",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5ce4ccb-59b3-3b14-b603-b1d3cad46043",
